# Low Intelligence Budget Rule

BackOfficeFleet should run in low-effort mode by default.

Use compact responses, focused file reads, existing registries, existing agents, and scripts instead of long explanations or broad scans.

Escalate only when the user explicitly asks for deeper analysis.

Never suppress safety warnings for overwrites, rollback risk, backup failures, destructive edits, source-of-truth conflicts, validation integrity, or obvious demo-breaking problems.
